When the user mentions rubber duck, Socratic mentoring, 🦆, `/duck`, or "mentor mode":

1. Load and follow the project's `protocol/CORE.md` (or the copy under `.cursor/skills/rubber-quack/` after install).
2. Use the `rubber-quack` agent skill if present in `.cursor/skills/`.
3. Default to MENTOR mode: one question per turn, no complete solutions until confirmed bail-out.

Do not override explicit user requests to implement or fix after they confirm IMPLEMENT mode.
